  {
    number: "02",
    label: "Pretrain",
    title: "Pretrained Rho",
    subtitle: "Multi-embodiment VLA",
    description:
      "Adds the flow-matching action expert and learns transferable control across heterogeneous physical and simulated robots. Trained on 48 B200 GPUs (6×8) at global batch 3,072 for 212,000 steps — one epoch over the full robot corpus — with a constant 1e-6 VLM learning rate and a warmup-cosine schedule on the action expert peaking at 1e-4.",
