            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption>
            Mid-training provides the largest gains in low-data adaptation and
            improves the 100% data result on the Hard protocol.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <details>
          <summary>Five-task leaderboard comparison</summary>
          <p class="note">
            The comparison uses Hanging Mug, Move Stapler Pad, Place Burger Fries,
            Handover Mic, and Stack Bowls Three. Leaderboard policies use different
